SUMMARY:Arrive Kyoto Station — drop luggage
LOCATION:Kyoto Station\, Hachijo Exit\, Shimogyo-ku\, Kyoto
DESCRIPTION:Coin lockers: ¥700 (large)\, Hachijo Exit.\nDrop bags at the A
 irbnb (4-chōme-432-6 Gojobashihigashi\, Higashiyama Ward\, Kyoto 605-0846
  — message host ahead) or Crosta Kyoto same-day delivery\, ~¥1\,000/bag
 \, drop off by 2pm.\nMap: https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=
 Kyoto+Station+Hachijo+Exit
BEGIN:VALARM
ACTION:DISPLAY
DESCRIPTION:Arrive Kyoto Station — drop luggage
TRIGGER:-PT30M
END:VALARM
END:VEVENT
