SUMMARY:Lunch: Kyoto Ramen Koji
LOCATION:10F Kyoto Station\, Higashishiokoji Kamadonocho\, Shimogyo-ku\, Ky
 oto
DESCRIPTION:Specialty: regional ramen — 8 stalls (Sapporo miso\, Hakata t
 onkotsu\, Kyoto shoyu\, etc).\nBuy tickets from the vending machine outsid
 e each stall. No reservation needed.\nMap: https://www.google.com/maps/sea
 rch/?api=1&query=Kyoto+Ramen+Koji+Kyoto+Station
BEGIN:VALARM
ACTION:DISPLAY
DESCRIPTION:Lunch: Kyoto Ramen Koji
TRIGGER:-PT30M
END:VALARM
END:VEVENT
