SUMMARY:Fushimi Inari Taisha (lower loop)
LOCATION:68 Fukakusa Yabunouchicho\, Fushimi-ku\, Kyoto 612-0882
DESCRIPTION:Lower loop up to the Yotsutsuji viewpoint (~1.5–2 hrs round t
 rip).\nPrice: free. Open 24 hrs.\nRoute: JR Nara Line\, Kyoto Station → 
 Inari Station\, 5 min (local trains only — not express).\nYou'll return 
 at dawn on Day 3 for the full hike to the summit.\nMap: https://www.google
 .com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Fushimi+Inari+Taisha
BEGIN:VALARM
ACTION:DISPLAY
DESCRIPTION:Fushimi Inari Taisha (lower loop)
TRIGGER:-PT30M
END:VALARM
END:VEVENT
