SUMMARY:Kiyomizu-dera + Sannenzaka/Ninenzaka
LOCATION:1-294 Kiyomizu\, Higashiyama-ku\, Kyoto 605-0862
DESCRIPTION:Price: ¥500. Open 6:00–18:00.\nWander the Sannenzaka/Ninenza
 ka slopes below for matcha sweets shops.\nMap: https://www.google.com/maps
 /search/?api=1&query=Kiyomizu-dera+Kyoto
BEGIN:VALARM
ACTION:DISPLAY
DESCRIPTION:Kiyomizu-dera + Sannenzaka/Ninenzaka
TRIGGER:-PT30M
END:VALARM
