SUMMARY:OPTIONAL: Gion bar-hopping
LOCATION:Gion / Kiyamachi-dori\, Kyoto
DESCRIPTION:Option A — L'Escamoteur: magic-themed cocktail bar\, opens 8p
 m. 138-9 Saitocho\, Shimogyo-ku\, Kyoto.\nMap: https://www.google.com/maps
 /search/?api=1&query=L%27Escamoteur+Kyoto\nOption B — Bee's Knees: Prohi
 bition-style speakeasy\, Asia's 50 Best Bars #76\, walk-in only. 364 Kamiy
 acho\, Nakagyo-ku\, Kyoto 604-0961.\nMap: https://www.google.com/maps/sear
 ch/?api=1&query=Bee%27s+Knees+Kyoto
BEGIN:VALARM
ACTION:DISPLAY
DESCRIPTION:OPTIONAL: Gion bar-hopping
TRIGGER:-PT30M
END:VALARM
END:VEVENT
