SUMMARY:Coffee + Bamboo Grove (Sagano)
LOCATION:%Arabica Kyoto Arashiyama\, 3-47 Saga Tenryuji Susukinobabacho\, U
 kyo-ku\, Kyoto 616-8385
DESCRIPTION:Coffee at %Arabica (global flagship\, riverside)\, then the Bam
 boo Grove.\nGo before 8:30 to beat tour groups.\nNote: heaviest walking da
 y of the trip — expect 15\,000+ steps today.\nMap: https://www.google.co
 m/maps/search/?api=1&query=%25Arabica+Kyoto+Arashiyama
BEGIN:VALARM
ACTION:DISPLAY
DESCRIPTION:Coffee + Bamboo Grove (Sagano)
TRIGGER:-PT30M
END:VALARM
END:VEVENT
