DTEND;TZID=Asia/Tokyo:20261110T100000
SUMMARY:Tenryu-ji Sogenchi Garden
LOCATION:68 Saga Tenryuji Susukinobabacho\, Ukyo-ku\, Kyoto 616-8385
DESCRIPTION:Price: ¥500 (garden only). Opens 8:30\, last entry 16:50.\nOne
  of Kyoto's finest Zen gardens.\nMap: https://www.google.com/maps/search/?
 api=1&query=Tenryu-ji+Arashiyama
BEGIN:VALARM
ACTION:DISPLAY
DESCRIPTION:Tenryu-ji Sogenchi Garden
TRIGGER:-PT30M
