SUMMARY:Lunch: Yudofu Sagano
LOCATION:45 Saga Tenryuji Susukinobabacho\, Ukyo-ku\, Kyoto 616-8385
DESCRIPTION:Specialty: yudofu (simmered hot tofu) kaiseki-style set\, priva
 te tatami rooms.\nOn Tabelog's curated "Best Tofu/Yuba" list for the area.
 \nNo reservations — arrive right at opening for lunch.\nMap: https://www
 .google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Yudofu+Sagano+Arashiyama
