SUMMARY:Dinner: Pontocho Alley
LOCATION:Pontocho-dori\, Nakagyo-ku\, Kyoto
DESCRIPTION:Various yakitori/kappo counters along the lantern-lit alley (ru
 ns Sanjo–Shijo\, one block west of the Kamo River).\nNo single reservati
 on needed — walk the lane and pick a spot with a queue of locals.\nMap: 
 https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Pontocho+Alley+Kyoto
BEGIN:VALARM
ACTION:DISPLAY
DESCRIPTION:Dinner: Pontocho Alley
TRIGGER:-PT30M
