SUMMARY:OPTIONAL: Evening cocktail bar
LOCATION:Nakagyo-ku / Shimogyo-ku\, Kyoto
DESCRIPTION:Option A — Bar Rocking Chair: machiya cocktail bar\, bartende
 r Kenji Tsubokura (former World Cocktail Champion). 434-2 Tachibanacho\, G
 okomachi-dori Bukkoji-sagaru\, Shimogyo-ku\, Kyoto.\nMap: https://www.goog
 le.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Bar+Rocking+Chair+Kyoto\nOption B — Noki
 shita711: reservation-only "liquid cuisine" tasting bar\, seats just 4 gue
 sts per sitting. 235 Sendocho\, Shimogyo-ku\, Kyoto 600-8019.\nBOOK WELL I
 N ADVANCE — not a walk-in.\nMap: https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api
 =1&query=Nokishita711+Kyoto
BEGIN:VALARM
ACTION:DISPLAY
DESCRIPTION:OPTIONAL: Evening cocktail bar
TRIGGER:-PT30M
END:VALARM
END:VEVENT
