SUMMARY:Fushimi Inari Taisha — dawn summit hike
LOCATION:68 Fukakusa Yabunouchicho\, Fushimi-ku\, Kyoto 612-0882
DESCRIPTION:Full hike to the summit this time — quiet\, ~2 hrs round trip
 \, best light of the day.\nPrice: free. Open 24 hrs.\nMap: https://www.goo
 gle.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Fushimi+Inari+Taisha
