SUMMARY:Brunch: Vermillion Cafe
LOCATION:5-31 Fukakusa Kaidoguchicho\, Fushimi-ku\, Kyoto 612-0805
DESCRIPTION:Specialty: avocado/poached-egg toast\, matcha and coffee drinks
 .\nRun by a Japanese owner who spent 18 years in Australia\; praised for c
 offee quality\, blankets provided for outdoor seating.\nOpen 8:30am–3pm.
 \nMap: https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Vermillion+Cafe+Fus
 himi+Inari
