SUMMARY:Kenninji Temple
LOCATION:584 Komatsucho\, Higashiyama-ku\, Kyoto 605-0811
DESCRIPTION:Price: ¥800. Opens 10:00\, last entry 16:30.\nKyoto's oldest Z
 en temple — the Twin Dragons ceiling painting (108 tatami mats) is the h
 ighlight.\nMap: https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Kenninji+K
 yoto
BEGIN:VALARM
