SUMMARY:Shogunzuka Seiryuden
LOCATION:28 Zushiokukacho\, Yamashina-ku\, Kyoto 607-8456
DESCRIPTION:Price: ¥500.\nArguably the best panoramic view over Kyoto — 
 far less crowded than Kiyomizu-dera's platform.\nShort taxi from Chion-in/
 Higashiyama.\nMap: https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Shogunz
 uka+Seiryuden
