SUMMARY:Dinner: Kichi Kichi Omurice — BOOKED?
LOCATION:185-4 Zaimokucho\, Sanjo Pontocho-dori Sagaru\, Nakagyo-ku\, Kyoto
DESCRIPTION:Specialty: theatrical tableside omurice by Chef Motokichi Yukim
 ura.\nOnly 14 seats — internationally famous\, books out WEEKS IN ADVANC
 E. RESERVE AS SOON AS DATES ARE LOCKED.\nFallback if you can't get in: Gio
 n Duck Noodles again\, or okonomiyaki at Gion Tanto (372 Kiyomotocho\, Hig
 ashiyama-ku\, Gion Shijo — always has a line).\nMap: https://www.google.
 com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Kichi+Kichi+Omurice+Kyoto\nFallback map: http
 s://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Gion+Tanto+Kyoto
BEGIN:VALARM
ACTION:DISPLAY
DESCRIPTION:Dinner: Kichi Kichi Omurice — BOOKED?
TRIGGER:-PT30M
END:VALARM
