SUMMARY:Nishiki Market
LOCATION:609 Nishidaimonjicho\, Nakagyo-ku\, Kyoto 604-8054
DESCRIPTION:"Kyoto's Kitchen" — many individual stalls close Sundays/Wedn
 esdays\, so Thursday works well.\nArrive before 10–11am while all stalls
  are open.\nMap: https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Nishiki+M
 arket+Kyoto
