SUMMARY:Coffee: Ogawa Coffee
LOCATION:519-1 Kikuyacho\, Nakagyo-ku\, Kyoto 604-8127 (Sakaimachi Nishiki 
 branch)
DESCRIPTION:Kyoto's own roaster\, founded 1952 — one of the city's three 
 historic coffee houses alongside Inoda and Maeda.\nMap: https://www.google
 .com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Ogawa+Coffee+Sakaimachi+Nishiki
