SUMMARY:OPTIONAL SWAP: Kyoto Int'l Manga Museum
LOCATION:Karasuma-Oike\, Nakagyo-ku\, Kyoto 604-0846
DESCRIPTION:Price: ¥900. Open 10:00–17:00 (open Thursdays — closed eve
 ry Wednesday\, which is why this isn't on Day 3).\nWorth it only if you're
  willing to trim Nishiki Market short — needs ~1.5 hrs on a departure mo
 rning.\nMap: https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Kyoto+Interna
 tional+Manga+Museum
